# Line endings are a repository property, not a per-developer setting.
#
# Without this file the result depends on each contributor's local
# core.autocrlf. A Windows checkout with autocrlf=false commits CRLF, and the
# same tree then behaves differently on the Linux host that runs the probe and
# the server. Normalising in the repository makes the platform irrelevant.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Data the tools parse byte-for-byte, and fixtures whose exact bytes are the
# point of the test.
*.json  text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf

# Never rewrite these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.gz    binary
*.zip   binary
